{"availability":"available","full":"falconrapid19925/saasmath","name":"saasmath","description":"Gamified Kumon-style daily math drills for Indonesian kelas 4-6 SD — Next.js PWA, deterministic drill engine, offline-first, Midtrans/WhatsApp ready","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-11T06:17:38Z","updated":"2026-10-11T08:32:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://falconrapid19925.github.io/saasmath/","topics":["bahasa-indonesia","drizzle-orm","education","indonesia","kumon","math","nextjs","playwright","pwa","react","sqlite","typescript","vitest"],"demo":"https://falconrapid19925.github.io/saasmath/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:33.306Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:33.306Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T21:13:33.306Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.265Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T21:13:33.306Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try the static demo: a GitHub Pages landing page (Bahasa Indonesia) with a playable drill that runs the real engine in the browser (generateSet, gradeItems). The full app needs a server, and the page says so.","SaasMath is a web app (PWA) for Indonesian children in kelas 4-6 SD. Each day the child plays one timed 10-15 minute math drill, built the way Kumon works. A ladder of small-step sets carries the curriculum, and each set has a Standard Completion Time (SCT) target. A mastery gate decides advancement, and a failed gate repeats the set as a freshly generated variant.","Grading is instant and wrong answers trigger same-session self-correction. When a child stays stuck, a Singapore-math CPA layer intervenes with a visual hint, such as a bar model (model batang), before the abstract form returns. A streak, stars, and a toko give the loop its gamification."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/falconrapid19925/saasmath/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1d4a2602539c79bc3148735948cf891815113819ebe760e0efb69a9c5bf5092f","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.394Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.394Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Try the static demo: a GitHub Pages landing page (Bahasa Indonesia) with a playable drill that runs the real engine in the browser (generateSet, gradeItems). The full app needs a server, and the page says so.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/falconrapid19925/saasmath/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The seed prints the demo login: parent demo@saasmath.id, child Budi, PIN 123456.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/falconrapid19925/saasmath/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Children sign in with name plus a 6-digit PIN, one policy shared by the server schema (lib/server/schemas.ts:pinSchema), the server actions, the API routes, the PinPad component, and the seed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/falconrapid19925/saasmath/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"1d4a2602539c79bc3148735948cf891815113819ebe760e0efb69a9c5bf5092f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/falconrapid19925/saasmath/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.394Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T08:32:27Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/falconrapid19925/saasmath/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.394Z","hash":"1d4a2602539c79bc3148735948cf891815113819ebe760e0efb69a9c5bf5092f","originalBytes":12477,"storedBytes":12477,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:01.265Z","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs","Maths & algorithms"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subjects":["Browser extensions & PWAs","Maths & algorithms"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Browser extensions & PWAs","source":"metadata","match":"PWA"},{"subject":"Maths & al